  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A photon of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{0}\"></span> scatters off an electron at rest. The shift in photon wavelength is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta\\lambda\"></span>. What is the kinetic energy of the scattered electron?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{hc}{\\Delta\\lambda}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{hc}{\\lambda_{0}+\\Delta\\lambda}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{hc}{\\lambda_{0}}-\\frac{hc}{\\Delta\\lambda}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{hc}{\\lambda_{0}}-\\frac{hc}{\\lambda_{0}+\\Delta\\lambda}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
